{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "1a368e2044edb6ae61295fae8f209729021ef4651fb81030f1b6995f8667eb69", "ja": "第二幕、終了！", "zh": "第二幕，结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5906352d07a5cd73830b0918615adef4ecad350caebdbd434dc66bf8dfa9ec36", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』公演、第二幕が終了。\n打ち上げのため全員で出かけるも、\nアイドル達のおしゃべりは止まらない。\n「主演は大変だけど、嬉しくて楽しい」\nという言葉に、頷くプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "“STARDOM ROAD”巡演第二幕圆满落幕。\n大家一起外出参加庆功宴，\n偶像们的闲聊却依旧停不下来。\n“虽然担任主演很不容易，但真的很开心、很愉快”\n听到这句话，制作人赞同地点了点头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8540879cdb7eabd210886b70c3672358c76dd4fba194296c9dd398ddbe4df06d", "ja": "(『STARDOM ROAD』第二幕は好評のまま、\n無事、千秋楽を迎えた。）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第二幕在广受好评中，\n顺利迎来了最终公演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d1eccea67b7acc26e8c81c9bb73c0ab2898cdc23b7865f2c132921a962d9fdc2", "ja": "（みんなの努力を称える意味でも、\n今日はちょっと高級なランチで打ち上げだ！）", "zh": "（为了犒劳大家的努力，今天就来一顿稍微高级点的午餐庆功吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "7da104eef0a991f88ad55198c9dd417eb04a101dcabf3f5fe9d3adf5acf8aa13", "ja": "みんな、本当にお疲れさま！　私は今回、\nマネージャー役だったっていうのもあるけど……。", "zh": "大家真的辛苦了！我这次也算是扮演了经纪人这个角色，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "8130e300f5224d701f2193f896144cb9eeb050ac290b090f75faaebdbf44becb", "ja": "アイドル候補生達を演じるみんなの熱量、\n今思い返しても、本当に凄かったと思うわ！", "zh": "我觉得，大家演绎偶像候补生时的热情，即使现在回想起来，也真的非常惊人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e59ea1df430c859ce7fefbc489730e3a5250d2023a2947180d7a95092a9936e4", "ja": "そうですね。けどあの熱量は、このみさんの\n後押しのおかげでもあると思います。", "zh": "是啊。不过那份热情，也多亏了木实小姐在背后支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "6eb6b493b2890394088eeab75cbdea3adcdc1e6a94d338d26591760a62028a05", "ja": "はい～。このみさんは演技について悩んでいると、\n必ず相談にのってくれました～。", "zh": "是的～每当我为演技烦恼时，这种美小姐总会听我倾诉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "41e5db8afe869df5bd7268d7f8818f11f5552d4c5963708e6e4c4bec2a12b5bc", "ja": "演技プランから表現の方法まで、\n一緒に考えてくれて……。", "zh": "从演技方案到表现方式，她都会和我一起思考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "b032e386846da71f5b87d8e2389f7477efa356f01c2a4c344dc62c59b71660a0", "ja": "本当に、勉強になりました～。\nありがとうございます～。", "zh": "真的学到了很多～  \n谢谢您～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "a3218b79d5704fd8781c333e3f9e5c03e6eea34ce4fe8e975c4f13b2bec12fc0", "ja": "やだ、そんなの当然よ！　それに、朋花ちゃんの\n静かな熱意に、私も応えたくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "哎呀，这都是理所当然的啦！而且，我也忍不住\n想要回应朋花那份沉静的热忱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9fdee713b2b5bda5cc46a8e0ab238c75b09c416d7e514b2b246b3232592b482b", "ja": "静かな熱意……。あ、そうか。\n第一幕の藍役は、まつりだったから……。", "zh": "安静的热情……啊，原来如此。因为第一幕的蓝是小祭演的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "2185afbd41f43772bc5549049a591ca6fd29a7d00d1fc1bafc01185b18be55d3", "ja": "……まつりさんだったから、なんですか～？", "zh": "……因为是茉莉小姐，所以怎么了呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "16806889c97122853670f165919acc5aa51326a5834110c7e7e4851126887a34", "ja": "いや！　劇場のみんなが、お互いライバルだからな！\n切磋琢磨するのは素晴らしい事だ！", "zh": "不！剧场的大家彼此都是竞争对手啊！\n互相切磋琢磨是一件非常棒的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7fcf09d227a94116953333f2fdef444c783cfca839cfb9ce1ef4766bafd2136d", "ja": "茜も、星梨花のレッスンに\n最後まで付き合ってくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "也谢谢茜一直陪星梨花练习到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "dd290b59d29af48beb393e9920c2db1e7fe46cb9e7995ddb3f4817a0d18a2e67", "ja": "そこに関しては茜ちゃんも予想外っていうか、\n今回はみんなの熱血に巻き込まれてね……！", "zh": "关于那个，小茜也算是始料未及吧，这次被大家的热血劲儿卷进去了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "c754cb397f8e53b995e978ffe87787759aeb95f80217300025a1344e9bc87c67", "ja": "まあ茜ちゃんは主演の経験もあるし、\n星梨花ちゃんの気持ちはよくわかったからね。", "zh": "不过小茜也有过担任主演的经历，\n所以很理解星梨花的心情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b48913912fb571b4e44631edea4e685dc3c9ec087ee7d8acda79aedc9871b76", "ja": "そうだったんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "c85d2ed24f4bc134e5e28cb5b106a4d491613595abe5d0815f6ab10a3d6d54aa", "ja": "うん！　主演はめちゃくちゃ大変だけど……\nめちゃくちゃ嬉しくて楽しいってこと☆", "zh": "嗯！虽然担任主演非常辛苦……\n但也真的特别开心、特别快乐☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "78d66836e66e6033a17d59e838f9812fbec75ba1a881865d0b49cb0ddfa016de", "ja": "あ……ふふっ。はい！\n主演はとってもうれしくて、楽しかったです！", "zh": "啊……呵呵。嗯！\n担任主演真的非常开心，也非常快乐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4bb0f2635cd3aa57dcfbc53a74f70ba0f3ab0d445e0584769067035de31df677", "ja": "そうだな。\nそれは茜が誰よりも知ってる事だったな。", "zh": "是啊。\n这件事，茜比谁都清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d27e44e9b72c3e0498ad3c36c837c734f7b376deb7977d8ee4085a3b6f2bece2", "ja": "（みんなが今まで培ってきた経験、\nしっかり活きているってことか……）", "zh": "（大家至今积累的经验，确实都派上用场了啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e7b4b3ee86727444f2c4c91468b1cf9169464e79c4fcfbff1b7adba39a4c8a79", "ja": "……おっと、おしゃべりが長くなったな。\n続きは店に入ってからにしようか。", "zh": "……哎呀，不知不觉聊了这么久。\n剩下的等进店之后再说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "259b1273383b0bdb6edb79df720a6038b50ad1640d625fdd6249182573293172", "ja": "はい～。", "zh": "是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d3120d644bcd5ae95e3548a5fd8ab0d74b956c40062c02c0712e7a2955ab656f", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』。アイドル達が繋いでいく\n公演は、これからどんな形へ成長していくのか……）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》。偶像们接力延续的公演，今后会成长成什么样子呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "38a660771c82fb89d1e2de772c1496bea05c7d2cbfb62d52a63945b505ab1b9e", "ja": "（みんなと一緒に、最後まで走り続けないとな）", "zh": "（必须和大家一起，一直跑到最后才行啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
